msgid ":icon:`fa-random` :doc:`Putaway Rules <../../shipping_receiving/daily_operations/putaway>`: This represents putaway rules that apply to a good, such as where to store it when a new shipment arrives."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type.rst:228
msgid ":icon:`fa-cubes` :doc:`Storage Capacities <../../shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category>`: This represents any storage capacity limitations specified for this good. For example, a warehouse may require that only ten (or less) sofas be stored there at any given time, due to their large size."
msgstr ""

