msgid "Warehouses"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management.rst:20
msgid ":doc:`Warehouses <inventory_management/warehouses>` represent a physical place, with a physical address, where a company's items are stored."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management.rst:23
msgid "Configure :doc:`routes <../shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes>` in a warehouse to control how products move to customers, from vendors, within the warehouse, or :doc:`between warehouses <replenishment/resupply_warehouses>`."
