msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:66
msgid "Components"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:68
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Components` tab of a |BOM|, specify components used to manufacture the product by clicking :guilabel:`Add a line`. From the :guilabel:`Components` drop-down menu, select from existing products or create a new product by typing the name and selecting either the :guilabel:`Create \" \"` option to quickly add the line item, or the :guilabel:`Create and edit...` option to add the component and continue to its configuration form. Alternatively, click :guilabel:`Catalog` to add components from the product catalog view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration.rst:83
msgid "Optionally, access additional fields by clicking the :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` :guilabel:`(settings adjust)` icon to the far-right of the :guilabel:`Components` tab. Tick the checkboxes for the following features to enable these columns:"
