msgid "The policy selected acts as the default for any new product created. Each policy acts as follows:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/manage_deals/manage.rst:30
msgid ":guilabel:`Ordered quantities`: creates a vendor bill as soon as a purchase order is confirmed. The products and quantities in the purchase order are used to generate a draft bill."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/manage_deals/manage.rst:32
msgid ":guilabel:`Received quantities`: a bill is only created **after** all (or part) of the total order has been received. The products and quantities received are used to generate a draft bill."
msgstr ""

