msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/manage_deals/rfq.rst:339
msgid "Once this setting is enabled, confirming an |RFQ| whose total is above the minimum amount moves it to the :guilabel:`To Approve` stage, instead of directly to :guilabel:`Purchase Order`. A user with the *Purchase Manager* role can then click :guilabel:`Approve Order` to confirm it."
